+to Wasi
+```
+$ mkdir tmp
+$ echo 'fn main() { println!("Hello World!"); }' | wasmtime run -Sthreads=y -Spreview2=n --dir tmp::/ --dir dist --env RUST_MIN_STACK=16777216 dist/bin/rustc.wasm - --sysroot dist --target wasm32-wasip1-threads -Csave-temps
